{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 3, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a journey to Nippon I shall weave for thee a most wondrous plan.\n\n**Day the First Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth alight\nIn Narita's port a dazzling sight.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy carriage shall glide\nA modern marvel where shadows reside.\nA hotel awaits a place of rest\nTo banish weariness and be blessed.\nThen wander forth through streets so bright\nAnd feast upon ramen in the fading light.\n\n**Day the Second Tokyo's Wonders**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall roam\nSenso-ji's grandeur a sacred home.\nThrough Nakamise-dori's lanes we'll tread\nWhere trinkets and treasures are widely spread.\nThen Shibuya's crossing a human stream\nA spectacle grand a waking dream.\nHarajuku's fashion a vibrant hue\nYouthful expression forever new.\nGinza's elegance a shopping spree\nLuxury's embrace for all to see.\n\n**Day the Third Hakone's Mountain Grace**\n\nTo Hakone we journey a scenic quest\nWhere Mount Fuji's beauty is truly blessed.\nA cruise on Lake Ashi a tranquil scene\nWith views of the mountain serene.\nThe Hakone Ropeway a thrilling ride\nVolcanic hot springs open wide.\nArt museums abound a cultured delight\nA peaceful escape both day and night.\n\n**Day the Fourth Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nBy bullet train swift we shall fly\nTo Kyoto's embrace beneath the sky.\nGion's district where geishas reside\nA glimpse of tradition with graceful stride.\nKiyomizu-dera Temple a wooden grace\nA panoramic view of this hallowed place.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vibrant maze\nThousands of torii in sunlit haze.\n\n**Day the Fifth Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a golden gleam\nReflecting in waters a waking dream.\nRyoan-ji's garden a Zen repose\nFifteen stones arranged where wisdom grows.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove a verdant sight\nSunlight filtering in ethereal light.\nNijo Castle's grandeur a shogun's hold\nStories of power bravely told.\n\n**Day the Sixth Nara's Deer and Temples**\n\nTo Nara we venture a deer-filled land\nTodai-ji Temple grandly planned.\nGreat Buddha's presence a sight to behold\nA story of faith centuries old.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine lanterns alight\nA mystical glow in the fading night.\nExplore Nara Park with friendly deer\nA whimsical moment held ever dear.\n\n**Day the Seventh Osaka's Culinary Delights**\n\nTo Osaka we travel a foodie's sphere\nDotonbori's lights banish all fear.\nTakoyaki and okonomiyaki a taste divine\nCulinary adventures truly shine.\nOsaka Castle's walls a history deep\nSecrets of emperors they safely keep.\nShinsekai's charm a retro grace\nA vibrant atmosphere a joyful space.\n\n**Day the Eighth Departure's Farewell**\n\nWith heavy heart we bid adieu\nTo Nippon's beauty forever true.\nFrom Kansai's airport thy journey takes flight\nCarrying memories both dazzling and bright.\nMay this adventure linger in thy soul\nA tale to recount making thee whole.\nFarewell Japan until we meet again\nMay fortune smile upon thee then.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.012519695796072483}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -1.4410643577575684}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.01015708688646555}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.2446068823337555}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.7082007527351379}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.039361197501420975}, {"token": "▁Nippon", "logprob": -0.5151941776275635}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -1.3854265213012695}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.005655122920870781}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.14495928585529327}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.10446355491876602}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -6.198863957251888e-06}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.11084061115980148}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -1.394366979598999}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.06835699826478958}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -0.634116768836